  (text "1x MODE ONLY: EN1 is held low; EN2 is pulled low by R1 and may be asserted by the MCU to select 1x. DIN is held low by R2 and receives the 3.2–4.0kHz tone signal." (at 35 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "a8904e00-0000-4000-8000-000000000088"))
  (text "Do not use 2x or 3x until differential VO1-to-VO2 waveform is measured and proven <=10Vp-p. PAM8904E 3x mode is not allowed at VIN >=4.5V." (at 35 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "a8904e00-0000-4000-8000-000000000089"))
  (text "CPT-2475-92T rating: 10Vp-p, 4kHz, 1/2 duty; 92dB minimum at 10cm; 21nF typical / 27.3nF max at 120Hz. This published rating does not meet proposed 105dB target." (at 35 266 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "a8904e00-0000-4000-8000-000000000090"))
  (text "All P_AUDIO_* and P_PIEZO_* nets are HOLD. Exact PAM8904E footprint land pattern, capacitor derating, logic rail and acoustic waveform are not validated. No sound output claim." (at 35 274 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "a8904e00-0000-4000-8000-000000000091"))
